    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the Market\r\n42 O’Carolan Court, Kilronan, Co. Roscommon – F52 EK03\r\n\r\n3 Bedroom Residence | Showhouse Condition | Located on the Grounds of Kilronan Castle\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this exceptional 3 bedroom two-storey residence, ideally located within the prestigious Kilronan Castle Estate & Spa.\r\n\r\nPresented in true showhouse condition throughout, No. 42 O’Carolan Court offers a rare opportunity to acquire a stylish home in a unique setting surrounded by mature woodland, scenic walks and lake views, all within a peaceful cul-de-sac development.\r\n\r\nThis property is perfectly suited as a family home, holiday retreat or investment property.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises:\r\n\r\nA bright and welcoming entrance hallway leads to a spacious and well-designed interior finished to a high standard throughout.\r\n\r\nThe living accommodation is both modern and functional, offering excellent natural light and a comfortable layout for everyday living.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen/dining area provides a central hub of the home, ideal for entertaining and family use, while the sitting room offers a relaxing space with quality finishes.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property comprises three well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, along with a main family bathroom.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n3 bedroom two-storey residence with master ensuite\r\nPresented in showhouse condition throughout\r\nLocated within the exclusive Kilronan Castle Estate\r\nQuiet cul-de-sac setting\r\nSurrounded by scenic woodland walks and lake views\r\nIdeal as a family home, holiday home or investment property\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nSituated on the grounds of Kilronan Castle, this property benefits from access to one of the most sought-after residential locations in the region.\r\n\r\nResidents can enjoy:\r\nBeautiful forest and lakeside walks\r\nA peaceful, secure environment\r\nClose proximity to Ballyfarnon Village\r\nEasy access to Carrick-on-Shannon and Boyle\r\nThis is a lifestyle location that offers both tranquillity and convenience  rarely found in today’s market.\r\n\r\nNo. 42 O’Carolan Court represents a unique opportunity to acquire a turnkey property in a premium setting with strong appeal for owner occupiers and investors alike.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended and strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents.\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\r\nMIPAV MMCEPI\r\nPSRA Licence No: 002031\r\n086 2130723 094 9362216\r\n\r\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: These particulars, including measurements, floor areas and property size, are for guidance only and may contain errors. They are not part of any contract. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information provided"
      },
